## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` | `:outline`, `:soft` | `:outline` | Bordered or filled; the steppers invert their fill. |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Width, steppers and text. |
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `Numeric` | - | Empty when missing. |
| `min:` / `max:` | `Numeric` | - | Clamp the value and disable the stepper at the bound. |
| `step:` | `Numeric` | `1` | Stepper and ↑/↓ increment. |
| `large_step:` / `small_step:` | `Numeric` | `step × 10` / `step ÷ 10` | Shift / Alt increments. |
| `format:` / `locale:` | `Hash` / `String` | - / `I18n.locale` | Intl.NumberFormat options and locale for the display. |
| `name:` | `String` | - | Hidden input with the plain number. |
| `allow_wheel_scrub:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Step with the mouse wheel while focused. |
| `read_only:`, `required:`, `disabled:`, `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | The usual states. |
| `input:` | `Hash` | `{}` | Attributes for the visible input. |

Event: `ui--number-field:change` with `{ value }` (`null` when empty).

## Accessibility

- A `role="spinbutton"` with `aria-valuenow`, min, max and (when formatted) `aria-valuetext`.
- The steppers are `<button>`s named "Increase value" / "Decrease value" (translated), out of the tab order.
- ↑/↓ step, Shift / Alt for the large / small step, Home / End jump to the bounds.
